# landchain-search

Minimal LangChain search project scaffold using `pyproject.toml`.

## Setup

```bash
cd /Users/shakir/langchain-attachment-demo/landchain-search
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
```
